#### 3_11 common

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_3_11_title"
	val[]: "Infinite Fun"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_3_11_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll make our way through two different roundabouts with the doubles."

#### 3_11 goal

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_3_11_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_start@@"

