#### train msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_cutscene1"
	val[]: "This training course will give you a small taste of real world driving within the safety of our training grounds. Put some of your new skills to the test, and remember to be aware of your surroundings and to use all of the room available to you. <br><br>It also pays to think ahead!"

#### train Driving Instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_forward"
	val[]: "Proceed forward and find your way into the course."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check1"
	val[]: "There's a downhill section ahead, you can use this to get a feel for the doubles combination at speed."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check2"
	val[]: "Prepare to brake for the turn ahead."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check3"
	val[]: "Cross through the median by turning right and then immediately to the left."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check4"
	val[]: "Cross through the median once again."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check5"
	val[]: "There are times when you will have no choice but to jack-knife the whole combination. <br><br>Do what you must to get through this extremely sharp turn."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check6"
	val[]: "Continue driving through the course."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check7"
	val[]: "Carefully negotiate the slalom, ensuring not only that your trailers make it past each barrier, but also that you are set up and prepared to make it around the following one."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check8"
	val[]: "Continue to the left and pass straight through the intersections."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check9"
	val[]: "Follow the tarmac to the right."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_check10"
	val[]: "The last turn is misleading; there is a lot of room, but be prepared to park up against the far kerb."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_train_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#@}

